{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T16:43:47.439581", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  import numpy as np\n\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode and obtain the initial observation\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Retrieve the list of possible action IDs from the environment's action specs\n  possible_actions = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Continue taking random actions until the environment signals that the episode is done\n  done = False\n  while not done:\n      # Sample a random action from the available actions\n      action = np.random.choice(possible_actions)\n      actions.append(int(action))\n\n      # Perform the action in the environment\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n\n      # Safety break to avoid infinite loops in pathological cases\n      if len(actions) > 10000:\n          break\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions taken during the episode\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 0, "scores": {"3": -1}}
