{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T16:51:27.613306", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode and obtain the initial observation.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine a reasonable step limit. Prefer the environment's own max_steps if available.\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  # Retrieve the list of possible action integers from the environment's spec.\n  action_values = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Execute a random policy until the episode terminates or we hit the step limit.\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Sample a random action.\n      action = np.random.choice(action_values)\n      # Apply the action to the environment.\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n      # Record the action taken.\n      actions.append(action)\n      # Stop if the task is completed (environment signals done).\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions taken during this episode.\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
