{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T16:54:21.499686", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy: reset the environment and take random actions\n  # until the episode is finished (or a safety step limit is reached).\n  # Returns the list of actions taken.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  # Get the integer action IDs from the environment's action specifications.\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  done = False\n  # Safety limit to avoid infinite loops in case of mis\u2011behaving environments.\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n  step_count = 0\n  while not done and step_count < max_steps:\n      a = int(np.random.choice(action_ids))\n      actions.append(a)\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(a)\n      step_count += 1\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
