{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:02:08.618276", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  observation = env.reset()\n  total_reward = 0.0\n  done = False\n\n  # Retrieve the list of possible actions from the environment\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  if not action_ids:\n      # If the environment reports no actions, exit immediately\n      return total_reward, observation\n\n  # Run a simple random policy until the episode finishes\n  while not done:\n      # Sample a random action from the available set\n      action = np.random.choice(action_ids)\n\n      # Step the environment; CraftLab.step returns (reward, done, observation)\n      reward, done, observation = env.step(action)\n\n      # Accumulate the reward\n      total_reward += reward\n\n  # Return the cumulative reward and the final observation\n  return total_reward, observation", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
