{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:05:26.192520", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize a list to record the actions taken.\n  actions = []\n\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode and obtain the initial observation.\n  _ = env.reset()\n\n  # Determine a reasonable step limit to avoid infinite loops.\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  # Choose a default \"no\u2011op\" action.  We select the first action defined in the\n  # environment's action specification (typically this will be a movement or\n  # USE action that does not affect the goal).  If the spec is empty we fall back\n  # to 0.\n  try:\n      no_op_action = list(env.action_specs().values())[0]\n  except Exception:\n      no_op_action = 0\n\n  done = False\n  while not done and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      # Perform the no\u2011op action.\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(no_op_action)\n      actions.append(no_op_action)\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions that were taken (may be empty if the env\n  # terminates immediately).\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
