{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:06:35.805678", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  _ = env.reset()\n  actions_taken = []\n  done = False\n\n  # Get the list of possible action indices from the environment\n  action_space = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Execute random actions until the episode ends\n  while not done:\n      action = np.random.choice(action_space)\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(int(action))\n      actions_taken.append(int(action))\n\n  # Return the sequence of actions performed\n  return actions_taken", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": -1}}
