{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:11:00.558029", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize environment and obtain the initial observation\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  # Retrieve the list of possible action IDs from the environment's action spec\n  action_vals = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  done = False\n\n  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the episode ends\n  while not done:\n      # Randomly select an action from the available actions\n      a = int(np.random.choice(action_vals))\n      actions.append(a)\n      # Apply the action to the environment\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(a)\n      # Prevent infinite loops in case something goes wrong\n      if len(actions) > 10000:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
