{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:19:02.873282", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and obtain the first observation\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine the set of possible action integers from the environment spec\n  action_values = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Use a sensible upper bound for the number of steps (fallback if not provided)\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Simple random policy: choose any available action uniformly at random\n      act = np.random.choice(action_values)\n\n      # Apply the action to the environment\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(int(act))\n\n      # Record the action taken\n      actions.append(int(act))\n\n      # Stop early if the episode has finished (goal reached or step limit)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
