{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:22:51.033793", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Initialize the environment and obtain the first observation\n  _ = env.reset()\n\n  # List of possible action IDs as defined by the environment\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Record the sequence of actions taken\n  action_sequence = []\n\n  # Perform a simple random\u2011action policy until the episode ends\n  for _ in range(1000):  # safety cap on maximum steps\n      # Sample a random action from the available actions\n      act = np.random.choice(action_ids)\n\n      # Execute the action; the step method returns (reward, done, observation)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n\n      # Store the action\n      action_sequence.append(act)\n\n      # Stop if the environment reports termination (goal reached or max steps)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return action_sequence", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 8, "scores": {"3": -1}}
