{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:25:06.640313", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple fallback policy: take random actions until the episode ends or a safety limit is reached.\n  # Returns the list of actions taken.\n  actions = []\n  # Reset the environment to start a new episode.\n  _ = env.reset()\n  done = False\n  # Retrieve the possible action IDs from the environment.\n  action_ids = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Safety cap to avoid infinite loops in pathological cases.\n  max_steps = 1000\n  while not done and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      # Choose a random action.\n      act = np.random.choice(action_ids)\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      actions.append(int(act))\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 9, "scores": {"3": -1}}
