{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:26:02.177274", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  version = getattr(env, 'version', None)\n  if version == 0:\n      return break_func_v0\n  if version == 1:\n      return break_func_v1\n  if version == 2:\n      return break_func_v2\n\n  # Default no\u2011op break function for unknown versions\n  def _noop(e, d):\n      return []\n  return _noop", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
