{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:42:47.650701", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n\n  # Get the list of possible action integers from the environment spec\n  possible_actions = list(env.action_specs().values())\n\n  # Simple random policy: keep taking random actions until the episode ends\n  # or a safety step limit is reached.\n  while not done and len(actions) < 1000:\n      act = int(np.random.choice(possible_actions))\n      actions.append(act)\n      _, done, _ = env.step(act)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 3, "scores": {"3": -1}}
