{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:50:15.846513", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode\n  try:\n      env.reset()\n  except Exception:\n      # Some environments may require a seed argument\n      env.reset(seed=0)\n\n  actions = []\n\n  # Determine a reasonable limit for steps (fallback to 1000)\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n\n  # Main loop: act randomly until the episode ends or step limit reached\n  for _ in range(max_steps):\n      # Sample a random valid action from the environment's action spec\n      action = np.random.choice(list(env.action_specs().values()))\n      _, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(action)\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 1, "scores": {"3": -1}}
