{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:52:44.741946", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to start a new episode and obtain the initial observation.\n  _ = env.reset()\n\n  # Retrieve the possible actions from the environment specification.\n  action_space = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  if not action_space:\n      # No actions available; return an empty plan.\n      return []\n\n  actions_taken = []\n  done = False\n  # Set a hard cap to avoid infinite loops in pathological cases.\n  max_steps = 1000\n\n  while not done and len(actions_taken) < max_steps:\n      # Simple random policy: pick any action uniformly at random.\n      act = np.random.choice(action_space)\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(act)\n      actions_taken.append(int(act))\n\n  return actions_taken", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": -1}}
