{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T17:56:00.839477", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment and obtain the initial observation\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n\n  # Upper bound on steps to avoid infinite loops\n  MAX_STEPS = 1000\n\n  for _ in range(MAX_STEPS):\n      # Extract the inventory from the observation (if available)\n      inventory = None\n      if isinstance(obs, dict) and \"features_dict\" in obs:\n          feats = obs[\"features_dict\"]\n          if isinstance(feats, dict) and \"inventory\" in feats:\n              inventory = feats[\"inventory\"]\n\n      # Simple heuristic:\n      #   * If we hold any item (non\u2011zero count) try to USE it (action 4)\n      #   * Otherwise pick a random movement action (0\u20113)\n      if inventory is not None and inventory.ndim == 1 and inventory.sum() > 0:\n          action = 4  # USE\n      else:\n          action = np.random.randint(0, 4)  # MOVE: DOWN, UP, LEFT, RIGHT\n\n      # Execute the chosen action\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(action)\n\n      # Terminate if the episode is finished\n      if done:\n          break\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 2, "scores": {"3": -1}}
