{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T18:10:45.443258", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Reset the environment to obtain the initial observation.\n  env.reset()\n\n  # Get the list of possible action integers from the environment.\n  action_dict = env.action_specs()\n  possible_actions = list(action_dict.values())\n\n  # Execute random actions until the task is completed or a safety limit is hit.\n  plan = []\n  done = False\n  while not done:\n      # Choose a random action from the available set.\n      action = int(np.random.choice(possible_actions))\n      # Apply the action; step returns (reward, done, observation).\n      _, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      plan.append(action)\n\n      # Prevent infinite loops in pathological cases.\n      if len(plan) > 10000:\n          break\n\n  return plan", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 6, "scores": {"3": -1}}
