{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T18:14:50.530502", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  actions = []\n  # reset environment and get initial observation\n  _ = env.reset()\n  done = False\n\n  # Determine a reasonable step limit\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", None)\n  if max_steps is None:\n      # fall back to a default large number if not provided\n      max_steps = 1000\n\n  # Choose an action space size\n  if hasattr(env, \"world\") and hasattr(env.world, \"n_actions\"):\n      n_actions = env.world.n_actions\n  else:\n      # try to infer from action_specs dictionary\n      try:\n          n_actions = len(env.action_specs())\n      except Exception:\n          n_actions = 5  # default to the five basic actions\n\n  while not done and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      # Randomly pick an action\n      action = int(np.random.randint(n_actions))\n      reward, done, _ = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(action)\n\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
