{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T18:26:39.495810", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy for CraftLab environment.\n  # Reset the environment and then take random actions until the episode finishes.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  done = False\n  # Get list of possible action indices.\n  try:\n      action_indices = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  except Exception:\n      # Fallback: assume actions are 0..env.n_actions-1 if attribute exists.\n      action_indices = list(range(getattr(env, \"n_actions\", 5)))\n  # Safety limit to avoid infinite loops.\n  max_steps = getattr(env, \"max_steps\", 1000)\n  step_count = 0\n  while not done and step_count < max_steps:\n      action = np.random.choice(action_indices)\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(int(action))\n      step_count += 1\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 7, "scores": {"3": -1}}
