{"timestamp": "2025-11-03T18:28:56.590902", "function_name": "break_func", "function_body": "  # Simple random policy: reset the environment and take random actions until done or a step limit.\n  # Returns the list of actions taken.\n  obs = env.reset()\n  actions = []\n  # Determine the available action integers from the environment's action specifications.\n  action_values = list(env.action_specs().values())\n  # Set a reasonable upper bound on steps to avoid infinite loops.\n  max_steps = 1000\n  while not env._is_done() and len(actions) < max_steps:\n      # Choose a random action.\n      action = np.random.choice(action_values)\n      # Execute the action.\n      reward, done, obs = env.step(action)\n      actions.append(action)\n  return actions", "env_interactions": 0, "island_id": 4, "scores": {"3": -1}}
